WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:06,100
So you really hurt yourself on purpose

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:25,080
Ayu, it’s my fault. Ayu, it’s my fault.

3
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:31,380
She sinks and everyone loses their flesh and blood. Why is her sinking meaning different from others?

4
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:36,510
Treat your body as a bargaining chip and refuse to treat yourself half the way

5
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:40,460
If there is any other way, a proud person like her

6
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,060
How could you break the situation at the cost of your own weakness?

7
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:46,880
Why are you so cruel to yourself?
